{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/dc75f8174615fabf614152ef7baf9ec8.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/dc75f8174615fabf614152ef7baf9ec8.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/dc75f8174615fabf614152ef7baf9ec8.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>STANDARD EDITION </strong>offers the core RENNSPORT experience with a broad lineup of cars and tracks to get you started on your digital motorsport journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M Hybrid V8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 963</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercedes-AMG GT3 2020</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 R (992)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M4 GT3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi R8 LMS GT3 evo II</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aston Martin Vantage GT3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >McLaren 720S GT3-Evo 2023</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 R EVO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi R8 LMS GT4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M4 GT4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 Cup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi RS 3 LMS 2022</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyundai Elantra N TCR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche Mission R</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praga R1</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracks</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hockenheimring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N\u00fcrburgring GP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit de Spa Francorchamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autodromo Nazionale Monza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8eta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytona International Speedway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michelin Raceway Road Atlanta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchard Road Street Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goodwood Hillclimb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuji International Speedway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeddah Corniche Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crest Da Cauras</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/29f534dd6e1cdd2a116a511f9c809a2f.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/29f534dd6e1cdd2a116a511f9c809a2f.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/29f534dd6e1cdd2a116a511f9c809a2f.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN A GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the virtual racing experience you\u2019ve been waiting for. Photo-realistic racing on highly detailed tracks, where the world\u2019s fastest players compete, and the solo drivers, modders and car enthusiasts find a place to share their passion for racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/30ee72a84f2a74e833fb0400d730aa8a.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/30ee72a84f2a74e833fb0400d730aa8a.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/30ee72a84f2a74e833fb0400d730aa8a.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM PRACTICE TO PODIUM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your racecraft in RENNSPORT with a range of single-player options. Start with the Championship Mode, where AI opponents will push you to rise through the ranks from rookie to pro, or take on Time Trials and climb the leaderboards, while Free Practice lets you hone your technique at your own pace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve designed each mode to help you improve your racecraft, with every challenge offering the chance to unlock new achievements and rewards \u2013 whether you\u2019re aiming for precision or want to build up confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/7713df526eebfbc0f2a8fa58e8ded678.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/7713df526eebfbc0f2a8fa58e8ded678.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/7713df526eebfbc0f2a8fa58e8ded678.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE ANYONE, ANYWHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive against other players across all platforms in thrilling multiplayer races, or rise through the ranks in league racing. RENNSPORT was built on a foundation of robust netcode and updated consistently to ensure fair, balanced and stable competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/617de65ade0c2b975755133c5d8e45f2.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/617de65ade0c2b975755133c5d8e45f2.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/617de65ade0c2b975755133c5d8e45f2.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL CARS - REAL BRANDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of the most exciting machinery in motorsport, built in close collaboration with real life car manufacturers from all over the world. All cars can be raced in single-class or multi-class race events.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/389f72de78888e262ff6b15cb7fbc2aa.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/389f72de78888e262ff6b15cb7fbc2aa.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/389f72de78888e262ff6b15cb7fbc2aa.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGENDARY LASER-SCANNED &amp; COMMUNITY-MADE TRACKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of racing at iconic laser-scanned locations and community-made creations across the world, featuring multiple circuit layouts and dynamic day-night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/f6fb43db10d185621a68e051d67c8566.poster.avif?t=1762153878\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/f6fb43db10d185621a68e051d67c8566.webm?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/extras/f6fb43db10d185621a68e051d67c8566.mp4?t=1762153878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAMPLE THE RACING BEFORE YOU BUY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download for free - The base game of RENNSPORT is free to download and contains one car (BMW M2 CS Racing) and one track (Founder\u2019s Track).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR RACERS. FROM RACERS.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004460?t=1762153878","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/0ba8cb00291ed4594857cd025ad0b86a7a280615/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762153878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/5eb1100c89fb02b0e212c8752e6961c6d5b981d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762153878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004460/5eb1100c89fb02b0e212c8752e6961c6d5b981d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762153878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","